flowchart TD
    A[Validated baseline config] --> B[Allocate experiment ID and atomic journal]
    B --> C[Acquire exclusive local lock]
    C --> D{Prior attempt status?}
    D -->|No attempt| E[Create numbered attempt]
    D -->|Completed| P[Verify best receipt and checksum]
    D -->|Stopped or manually abandoned| E
    D -->|RUNNING and receipt present| F[Validate receipt and checkpoint SHA256]
    D -->|RUNNING and no receipt| X[BLOCK: no silent rerun]
    F -->|Valid| G[Commit prior result once]
    F -->|Invalid| X
    G --> D
    E --> H[Persist RUNNING before trainer starts]
    H --> I[CPU synthetic trainer plus monitor]
    I --> J[Write simulated checkpoint metadata]
    J --> K[Atomic completion receipt]
    K --> L[Verify and commit result]
    L --> M{Training outcome?}
    M -->|Completed| P
    M -->|Overfit or underfit| N{Approved patch and retry budget?}
    M -->|Divergence / unknown| X
    N -->|Yes| E
    N -->|No approved patch| X
    N -->|Budget exhausted| P
    P --> Q[active.yaml: best verified config]
    Q --> R[Experiment terminal state; no automatic deployment]
    X --> S[Operator inspects and resolves]
